 //! follow the iTNC 530 Klartext manual for NC software 34049x-03 (533 190-22).
-//! Gate map: covers assets/posts/heidenhain-klartext.cps, post::machine, post::engine.
+//! Gate map: covers assets/posts/heidenhain-klartext.cps, post::machine, post::engine,
